abstract: >
  Sanitized historical cohort projections and opaque replay inputs for 400
  scripted attempts and 911 LLM attempts, plus a separate 300-attempt local
  comparison and ten task observations performed by the author. Includes
  pinned offline six-policy five-capacity request-hit and byte-hit replay.
